<title>JAPAN: NCB says can post profit with current stock level.</title>
<headline>NCB says can post profit with current stock level.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that the bank would be able to post a current profit for the financial year ending March 31 if Tokyo stock prices remain at their current levels.</p>
</text>
